<title>USA: FREE TO TRADE -- Ocean Cty, N.J., deal at 1200 EDT.</title>
<headline>FREE TO TRADE -- Ocean Cty, N.J., deal at 1200 EDT.</headline>
<text>
<p>OCEAN COUNTY UTILITIES AUTHORITY</p>
<p>(NEW JERSEY)</p>
<p>RE: $195,000,000</p>
<p>WASTEWATER REVENUE BONDS, REFUNDING SERIES 1997</p>
<p>Effective at 12:00 Noon E.D.T., Wednesday, May 14, 1997</p>
<p>all syndicate terms and price restrictions are removed</p>
<p>and the bonds will be free to trade.</p>
<p>Dillon, Read &amp; Co. Inc.</p>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Commerce Capital, A Division of Commerce Bank.</p>
<p>First Union Capital Markets Corp. - NJ</p>
<p>E.A. Moos &amp; Co.</p>
<p>A.H. Williams &amp; Company</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
